sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Operator
    participant Browser as Next.js console
    participant Auth as Backend /auth
    participant Store as PostgreSQL

    Operator->>Browser: Submit credentials
    Browser->>Auth: POST /auth/token
    Auth->>Store: Verify user and create refresh session
    Auth-->>Browser: Access token + httpOnly refresh cookie
    Browser->>Browser: Keep access token in memory
    Browser-->>Operator: Render protected routes
    Browser->>Auth: POST /auth/refresh after reload or expiry
    Auth->>Store: Rotate refresh token and detect reuse
    Auth-->>Browser: New access token + rotated cookie
